# NOT-A-REAL-KEY — placeholder for the Kameas ML engine release public key
# (engine-publication-01ENPUB01 WP-H2). While this file holds no key line,
# the harness seeds NOTHING into the trust store and engine installs keep
# failing closed (anchor_missing) unless an operator/fleet installs the key.
#
# SWAP POINT: replace this file's contents with the `kenaz-ml-release.pub`
# written by `go run ./cmd/kenaz-ml-sign keygen --out-dir <dir>` (one line,
# 64 lowercase hex chars), or override per build with
#   -ldflags "-X github.com/kameas-ai/kenaz-harness/core/mlsidecar.releaseSigningPubKeyHex=<hex>"
# (see the commented engine-pin step in .github/workflows/release.yml).
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored. An all-zero key is also treated as
# a placeholder.
